<title>USA: Peoples Financial to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Peoples Financial to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>MASSILLON, Ohio 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peoples Financial Corp said on Wednesday it plans to buy back up to five percent of its shares over the next 12 months, starting on June 23, 1997.</p>
<p>The number of shares to be purchased and the price to be paid will depend upon the availability of shares, the prevailing market prices and any other considerations, Peoples Financial said.</p>
<p>The company has about 1.49 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
